# Changelog

## 3.0.0

- Rebuilt Driver Manager around hardware-first detection.
- Added missing driver/firmware scan separate from installation.
- Added `Install All + Update & Upgrade` full setup workflow.
- Added missing-driver-only installation workflow.
- Added exact PCI hardware ID mapping support.
- Added conservative BCM43142 `14e4:4365` → `broadcom-sta-dkms` mapping.
- Added GPU detection and active kernel-driver reporting.
- Added kernel firmware error detection from `dmesg`.
- Added post-install hardware verification.
- Added reboot-required detection.
- Added `--setup`, `--install-missing`, `--update`, `--upgrade`, and `--update-upgrade` CLI actions.
- Added terminal clearing between menu actions.
- Removed the old arbitrary driver-profile menu from the main workflow.
